OL,3,GNEWSABroads hoard yields rare Bronze
OL,4,AAge button
OL,5,
OL,6,FA late Bronze Age button has been
OL,7,Fdiscovered with a hoard of axe heads in
OL,8,Fa find that is exciting experts.
OL,10,FWhile buttons are taken for granted
OL,11,Ftoday, examples of their use 3,000
OL,12,Fyears ago were described as "very, very
OL,13,Frare" by archaeologist Dr Helen Geake.
OL,15,FThe discovery was made by a metal
OL,16,Fdetectorist in 2023 near Barton Turf,
OL,17,Fon the northern edge of the Norfolk
OL,18,FBroads. It has been declared treasure
OL,19,Fby a coroner.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
